usic) in one block\n- **width / height**: set via Resolution Selector. H3's native canvas is a 768px short edge, capped at 768x1344 pixels, rounded to a multiple of 32\n- **duration (seconds)**: converted to a valid frame `length` by the Math Expression node, snapping up to the model's 17-frame-per-block (17k+5) grid at 24fps"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax H3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#000", "size": [450, 630], "pos": [-2867.511962890625, 4672.130859375], "id": 116, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "positive", "links": [238], "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "positive"}, {"name": "LATENT", "links": [236], "label": "LATENT", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "Latent"}], "size": [430, 550], "pos": [-10, 4900], "widgets_values": ["For the target video, at 0.00 seconds into the target video, <Picture 1> (from [Shot 1]) is fully referenced.\n\n  integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic. The young woman shown in <Picture 1> stays leaning\n  against the painted cave wall, fully preserving her facial features, her long black hair, the sheer pale-apricot\n  embroidered outer robe, the vermilion under-dress, the pale mint sash at her waist, and the long gold earring. The\n  camera pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed while she holds her position against the wall and keeps her gaze\n  on the lens, her head turning by only a few degrees. Loose strands of hair drift slowly across her cheek in a faint\n  air current, the translucent sleeve settles against her arm, and her shoulders rise and fall with quiet breathing. She\n  blinks once, unhurried. The hard side light continues to separate her face and the folds of the robe from the\n  surrounding darkness, the faded ochre, malachite and cinnabar figures of the mural stay fixed on the wall behind her,\n  and the dim corridor recedes into shadow beyond her shoulder. The shot ends with her still leaning against the wall,\n  eyes on the lens.\n\n  overall_soundscape: A hollow low-frequency room tone fills the stone cave with long, soft reverberation. Silk rustles\n  faintly as the sleeve shifts against her arm, and a thin draft moves along the corridor. Her breathing is slow and\n  barely audible.\n\n  non_diegetic_music: A sustained low bamboo flute tone holds beneath sparse plucked guzheng notes at a slow tempo. A\n  soft frame drum enters with widely spaced beats, and the overall volume rises gradually toward the end.", 1344, 768, 73], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 241, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 242, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "first_frame", "link": 261, "label": "first_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "first_frame"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "last_frame", "label": "last_frame", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "last_frame"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 275, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "link": 263, "label": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "width"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "link": 264, "label": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "height"}, {"widget": {"name": "length"}, "name": "length", "link": 245, "label": "length", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "length"}], "flags": {}, "id": 133, "type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.29.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"width": true, "length": true, "height": true}, "Node name for S&R": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "output", "links": [